{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11221190","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11221190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1122119001:1":{"text":"はっ、シルバービークみてぇな自己中野郎にも子分ができるとはなぁ。あいつに騙されるなんて、お前たちもとんだ大バカ野郎だぜ！","source_cn":"哈，像银喙这种自私自利的混蛋，居然还能招到小弟？你们是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17C2CC1BD38B5C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122119002:1":{"text":"バ、バカはそっちだろ！おいらは賢いんだからな！","source_cn":"你……你才笨！我告诉你，我老憨可是最精明的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BBA45F92C118F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122119003:1":{"text":"お前みたいな出来損ないがバウンティハンターとはねぇ、どうせシルバービークにかつがれたんだろ？","source_cn":"就你这种货色，怎么当上赏金猎人的？别是银喙把你坑来的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6112D59796803401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122119004:1":{"text":"裏切り、情報の横流し、宝の独り占め……さんざんエグいことやって来たあいつの下にいたら、ろくなことにならねぇぞ？","source_cn":"他过去可是做了不少烂事，背叛同伴、出卖情报、侵吞财宝…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9303FD336DCE65C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122119005:1":{"text":"でたらめを言うな！俺は長いことあいつの相棒をやってるが、一度もそんなことをされた覚えはない！","source_cn":"胡扯！我和银喙搭档的时间也不短了，从来没见他做过这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE62C5A03CA2FCEED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"",